repository-code: "https://github.com/andreyivan4enkov/moe-orbit-prefetch"
abstract: >
  Open research code for predicting and loading MoE expert weight slices from
  embedding/residual signals (OrbitPredictor + DynamicExpertStore), with
  verified lab notes on expert-slice residency and prefetch miss-wait.
  Does not claim identity with DeepSeek's trained gate or chat-memory (Object B).
keywords:
  - mixture-of-experts
  - expert-prefetch
  - dynamic-inference
  - deepseek
